</div></div></div><div class="pf-c pf-sm-hide pf-hide" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-12_ pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><a href="https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/get-tps-omni-special-offer" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-hGPBjI dSAeLN pf-13_ pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-15_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Get 40% Off</span></span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-eJwWfJ gOTWZO pf-16_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-jeraig gFfZqp"><div class="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-17_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-18_"><h1 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ezbkAF deEGdS pf-19_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-21_">I Tested A Device That Saves You Hours By Automatically Finding &amp; Backing Up Your Photos And Videos With ONE Click… But I Never Expected This!</span></h1></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-eJwWfJ gOTWZO pf-22_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-jeraig gFfZqp"><div class="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-23_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-24_"><a data-action="url" href="https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/get-tps-omni-special-offer" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-hiCibw ekDlzN pf-25_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-8f4e332e--advertorial1640kb.jpg?v=1629316445" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-8f4e332e--advertorial1640kb.jpg?v=1629316445 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-8f4e332e--advertorial1640kb_500x.jpg?v=1629316445 320w" width="545" height="545" alt="Stop missing picture perfect moments because of full storage!" class="sc-jJoQJp hALhgP"/></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-eJwWfJ gOTWZO pf-26_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-jeraig gFfZqp"><div class="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-27_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-28_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ezbkAF deEGdS pf-29_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-31_"><span style="font-style: italic;">Do you have a lot of photos and videos stored on your computer and/or phone? Read this article closely… it could prevent a tragedy!</span></span></h2><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-32_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-34_"><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">As a computer repair technician, I get desperate phone calls from customers every day.</span><br><br>They usually sound something like this:
<br><br><span style="font-style: italic;">“PLEASE help me! I put my phone on the hood of the car for one second and forgot about it when I drove away. <span style="font-weight: bold;">Now it won’t turn on… and I have YEARS of family photos on there</span>.”
</span><br><br>&nbsp;Or… <span style="font-style: italic;">“I don’t know what happened.<span style="font-weight: bold;"> I was on my computer playing solitaire when the screen suddenly turned black</span>… I’m afraid to touch it. I JUST moved my vacation photos with my grandchildren to my computer and deleted them off my phone… is there any hope?”</span><br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Of course, I tell all my customers to “ALWAYS BACK UP” – but hardly any of them do.</span> And honestly, I understand why – it takes a TON of effort to back up all your most important files!<br><br>First, you have to dig through all those folders across ALL your devices… then organize all your photos and videos… and then you have to go through each file and figure out which ones you’re going to back up, removing the duplicates you’ve already backed up in the past. You can easily spend hundreds of hours going through everything!<br><br>We’d all rather spend our free time doing just about anything else. But get this: <span style="font-weight: bold;">140,000 hard drives crash EVERY WEEK</span> in the United States alone…
<br><br>And as a result, <span style="font-weight: bold;">about 46% of internet users lose their files every year</span>.<br><br> 
</span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/get-tps-omni-special-offer" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-hiCibw ekDlzN pf-35_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-79e744c9--advertorial0240kb.jpg?v=1629316420" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-79e744c9--advertorial0240kb.jpg?v=1629316420 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-79e744c9--advertorial0240kb_500x.jpg?v=1629316420 320w" width="545" height="545" class="sc-jJoQJp hALhgP"/></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-eJwWfJ gOTWZO pf-36_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-jeraig gFfZqp"><div class="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-37_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-38_"><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-39_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-41_"><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">That’s millions of precious memories… lost forever.</span><br><br>To recover them, you either have to figure it out on your own… or pay a technician like me $300 - $500 with no guarantees!<br><br>I get dozens of calls for this every week… and very few end well.<br><br>So naturally, I was MORE than a bit skeptical when my friend called to say he had found a <span style="font-weight: bold;">new gadget that does all your backups FOR YOU… on ALL your devices… and it saves them in ONE secure physical location</span>.<br><br>It sounded unbelievable. I had seen my fair share of flimsy thumb drives and “unhackable” cloud-based services—that just get hacked 2 weeks later.<br><br>But, I decided to test out this new device anyway… mostly to make my friend happy.<br><br>And I was SHOCKED when I discovered that it <span style="font-weight: bold;">ACTUALLY WORKS — and it’s both SECURE &amp; EASY to use</span>. Let me explain…<br>
</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-eJwWfJ gOTWZO pf-42_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-jeraig gFfZqp"><div class="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-43_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-44_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ezbkAF deEGdS pf-45_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-47_">What Is This New Easy-to-Use Backup Gadget?
<br><br></span></h2><a data-action="url" href="https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/get-tps-omni-special-offer" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-hiCibw ekDlzN pf-48_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-e744c96e--advertorial031.jpg?v=1629316425" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-e744c96e--advertorial031.jpg?v=1629316425 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-e744c96e--advertorial031_500x.jpg?v=1629316425 320w" width="545" height="545" class="sc-jJoQJp hALhgP"/></a><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-49_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-51_"><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">It’s called <a href="https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/get-tps-omni-special-offer" target="_blank">ThePhotoStick Omni</a>.</span><br><br>It’s a revolutionary device that <span style="font-weight: bold;">automatically finds, sorts, and saves</span> up to 60,000 photos and videos across ANY of your devices <span style="font-weight: bold;">with just ONE click</span>.<br><br>Even better, you only need one of them for all your devices! ThePhotoStick Omni works on:<br><br>• All Windows computers<br>• All Mac (Apple) computers<br>• All smartphones (iPhones, Android, iOS, etc.)<br>• All tablets (Galaxy, iPad, etc.)<br><br>This means you can now safely store, access, and share ALL of your precious photo and video memories in a matter of minutes… no matter where they are… with ONE device. It’s going to prevent so many irreplaceable photos &amp; videos from being lost!</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-52_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-53_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ezbkAF deEGdS pf-54_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-56_">How Does ThePhotoStick Omni Work?
</span></h2><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-57_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-59_"><br>This is where I was pleasantly surprised. <span style="font-weight: bold;">Most backup systems are WAY too complicated for the average user… which results in a lot of tragic mistakes.</span><br><br>Not only do backups take a LONG time, <span style="font-weight: bold;">one little mistake can cause all those precious memories to be erased</span>. And digging through your folders to find all those files is always a nightmare… you’ll never know if you missed an important photo or video until it’s too late.<br><br>But that’s what makes ThePhotoStick OMNI different. <span style="font-weight: bold;">It does everything FOR YOU in just 3 simple steps:
<br></span><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">
STEP 1:</span> Plug the stick into ANY device that has your photos or videos.<br><br></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/get-tps-omni-special-offer" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-hiCibw ekDlzN pf-60_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-c779e744--advertorial012.jpg?v=1629316416" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-c779e744--advertorial012.jpg?v=1629316416 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-c779e744--advertorial012_500x.jpg?v=1629316416 320w" width="545" height="545" class="sc-jJoQJp hALhgP"/></a><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-61_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-63_"><br><span style="font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;">NOTE: It comes with a universal attachment that will fit onto any computer, phone, or tablet – even if it doesn’t have a USB slot.</span><br><br></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/get-tps-omni-special-offer" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-hiCibw ekDlzN pf-64_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-8b541e8f--advertorial122.jpg?v=1629316436" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-8b541e8f--advertorial122.jpg?v=1629316436 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-8b541e8f--advertorial122_500x.jpg?v=1629316436 320w" width="545" height="545" class="sc-jJoQJp hALhgP"/></a><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-65_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-67_"><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">STEP 2:</span> Open the program.

<br><br></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/get-tps-omni-special-offer" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-hiCibw ekDlzN pf-68_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-6e8b541e--advertorial1140kb.jpg?v=1629316434" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-6e8b541e--advertorial1140kb.jpg?v=1629316434 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-6e8b541e--advertorial1140kb_500x.jpg?v=1629316434 320w" width="545" height="545" class="sc-jJoQJp hALhgP"/></a><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-69_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-71_"><br><span style="font-weight: 700;">STEP 3: </span>Click ‘GO’

<br></span></p><a data-action="url" href="https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/get-tps-omni-special-offer" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-hiCibw ekDlzN pf-72_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-c96e8b54--advertorial102.jpg?v=1629316431" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-c96e8b54--advertorial102.jpg?v=1629316431 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-c96e8b54--advertorial102_500x.jpg?v=1629316431 320w" width="545" height="545" class="sc-jJoQJp hALhgP"/></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-eJwWfJ gOTWZO pf-73_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-jeraig gFfZqp"><div class="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-74_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-75_"><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-76_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-78_">In the time it takes to walk your dog, ThePhotoStick Omni will scan every inch of your device to find each and every irreplaceable photo or video, and automatically back up ALL your precious memories.<br><br>Even better, it will <span style="font-weight: bold;">automatically remove any duplicate files — saving you time while maximizing the storage space on your devices</span>.<br><br>Doing this on your own would take you HOURS… and HOURS… and HOURS. And without ThePhotoStick Omni, there’s no guarantee that you’ll find everything — it’s so easy to miss files hidden on your computer!<br></span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-79_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-80_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ezbkAF deEGdS pf-81_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-83_">Even Better: ThePhotoStick Omni Works On ALL Files!</span></h2><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-84_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-86_"><br>Here’s another feature I found to be really helpful: ThePhotoStick Omni will actually find and backup <span style="font-weight: bold;">MORE than just photos and videos</span>.<br><br>It also does <span style="font-weight: bold;">documents, voice memos, and music files—over 100 different file types</span>—and organizes them all FOR YOU automatically on the stick.<br><br>Bonus: This makes it so easy to fix that dreaded <span style="font-weight: bold;">“Storage At Maximum Capacity. Please delete files to make room.”</span> pop-up message. Just plug in ThePhotoStick Omni and you’re good to go!<br><br>PLUS… ThePhotoStick Omni isn’t ONLY useful when it comes to backing up your photos.<br></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-eJwWfJ gOTWZO pf-87_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-jeraig gFfZqp"><div class="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-88_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-89_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ezbkAF deEGdS pf-90_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-92_">You’ll Also Save HOURS of Time When You Want to Find Some Photos To Share With Friends &amp; Family<br><br></span></h2><a data-action="url" href="https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/get-tps-omni-special-offer" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-hiCibw ekDlzN pf-93_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-541e8f4e--advertorial1440kb.jpg?v=1629316439" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-541e8f4e--advertorial1440kb.jpg?v=1629316439 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-541e8f4e--advertorial1440kb_500x.jpg?v=1629316439 320w" width="545" height="545" class="sc-jJoQJp hALhgP"/></a><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-94_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-96_"><br><span style="font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;">Sharing with ThePhotoStick Omni is easy — just click “Share”…

